# The bow zone: "steel pad" on the chord track (P2 245: the bow sustains the strings, slow attack), then "e-bow"
# on the lead; note-off lifts the bow and damps the strings (release 120 / 70).
tempo 90
steps 16
tail 4.0
track chord
preset 80 245 70 0 255 120 0 0 128 0 128 150 0 0 0 0 0 0
note 0 D3 8 100
note 0 Gb3 8 100
note 0 A3 8 100
track lead
preset 70 240 40 0 255 70 0 0 128 0 128 185 0 0 0 0 0 0
note 8 A4 6 110
expect sound 2 14
expect idle 48
expect peak_below 0
